<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>HE_Doctrine_Roma</defName>
    <label>testudo drill</label>
    <description>Legionaries close ranks and lock their shields into a roof. Packed together they shrug off arrows and blows, but they march slowly.

The more comrades stand within three cells, the stronger it is.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.66, 0.36)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <minSeverity>0.001</minSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HediffCompProperties_HeirsDoctrine">
        <formationRadius>2.9</formationRadius>
        <formationFull>4</formationFull>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>broken ranks</label>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.24</minSeverity>
        <label>loose line</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.1</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.05</ArmorRating_Blunt>
          <MoveSpeed>-0.2</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.74</minSeverity>
        <label>shield roof</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.2</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.1</ArmorRating_Blunt>
          <MoveSpeed>-0.4</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>HE_Doctrine_Hellas</defName>
    <label>phalanx drill</label>
    <description>Hoplites fight shoulder to shoulder, each shield covering the man to the left. In the line they are hard to hit and hard to escape; alone they are ordinary men.

The more comrades stand within three cells, the stronger it is.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.66, 0.36)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <minSeverity>0.001</minSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HediffCompProperties_HeirsDoctrine">
        <formationRadius>2.9</formationRadius>
        <formationFull>4</formationFull>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>broken line</label>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.24</minSeverity>
        <label>loose phalanx</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.06</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <MeleeHitChance>2</MeleeHitChance>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>2</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
      <li>
        <minSeverity>0.74</minSeverity>
        <label>closed phalanx</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.12</ArmorRating_Sharp>
          <MeleeHitChance>4</MeleeHitChance>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>4</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statOffsets>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>HE_Doctrine_Nord</defName>
    <label>strandhogg drill</label>
    <description>The shore raid: no siege and no waiting. Raiders cut through walls with axes and run at the enemy, fast, fierce and hard to stop with pain.

It lasts while the raider fights for the raid.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.66, 0.36)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <minSeverity>0.001</minSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HediffCompProperties_HeirsDoctrine" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>raider's fury</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <MoveSpeed>0.3</MoveSpeed>
          <MeleeHitChance>3</MeleeHitChance>
        </statOffsets>
        <painFactor>0.85</painFactor>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>HE_Doctrine_Yamato</defName>
    <label>bushido drill</label>
    <description>Samurai attack in small bands from several sides at once and pick their targets with care. Calm in the face of death, they fight on through wounds.

It lasts while the raider fights for the raid.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.66, 0.36)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <minSeverity>0.001</minSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HediffCompProperties_HeirsDoctrine" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>way of the warrior</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <MeleeHitChance>3</MeleeHitChance>
          <MeleeDodgeChance>3</MeleeDodgeChance>
        </statOffsets>
        <painFactor>0.85</painFactor>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>HE_Doctrine_Tianxia</defName>
    <label>art of war drill</label>
    <description>Every battle is won before it is fought. Tianxia armies gather out of reach, wait for the right moment and then strike with drilled crossbow volleys.

It lasts while the raider fights for the raid.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.66, 0.36)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <minSeverity>0.001</minSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HediffCompProperties_HeirsDoctrine" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>drilled volleys</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <ShootingAccuracyPawn>3</ShootingAccuracyPawn>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <AimingDelayFactor>0.85</AimingDelayFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>HE_Doctrine_Albion</defName>
    <label>siege train drill</label>
    <description>Albion comes with spades and guns. Its armies often dig in and build a battery before they attack, and its riflemen fire steady, measured volleys.

It lasts while the raider fights for the raid.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.66, 0.36)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
    <minSeverity>0.001</minSeverity>
    <maxSeverity>1</maxSeverity>
    <everCurableByItem>false</everCurableByItem>
    <comps>
      <li Class="HeirsOfEarth.HediffCompProperties_HeirsDoctrine" />
    </comps>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>volley fire</label>
        <statOffsets>
          <ShootingAccuracyPawn>3</ShootingAccuracyPawn>
          <MoveSpeed>-0.1</MoveSpeed>
        </statOffsets>
        <statFactors>
          <AimingDelayFactor>0.8</AimingDelayFactor>
        </statFactors>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>HE_Doctrine_Kemet</defName>
    <label>chariot vanguard drill</label>
    <description>Kemet's attack opens with speed: the vanguard runs ahead as the chariots once did and is on the walls before the defenders are ready.

It lasts while the raider fights for the raid.</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.85, 0.66, 0.36)</defaultLabelColor>
    <initialSeverity>0.01</initialSeverity>
